<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN PREMIER LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Russian premier</p>
<p>league matches played on Monday:</p>
<p> Dynamo-Gazovik Tyumen*     0  Rostselmash Rostov	   1</p>
<p> Fakel Voronezh*		0  Zenit St. Petersburg	 1</p>
